{"timestamp":"2026-08-28 11:08:00","level":"INFO","message":"node_dispatch","schema_version":1,"event_type":"node_dispatch","status":"routed","mode":"state_machine","session_id":"bcs_grp_f6fadc71b4fc41a1bb3aa16d57ffb11b:13b8e236","group_id":"bcs_grp_f6fadc71b4fc41a1bb3aa16d57ffb11b","state_machine_run_id":"sm-9341c9dc-97c3-4ab8-9c76-d4d743133816","run_id":"smnode-sm-9341c9dc-97c3-4ab8-9c76-d4d743133816-vote_open-1","node_id":"vote_open","attempt":1,"bot_id":"谁是卧底主持人","assignee_bot_id":"谁是卧底主持人","delivery_request_id":"smnode-sm-9341c9dc-97c3-4ab8-9c76-d4d743133816-vote_open-1","content":"[State Machine Task]\nnode_id: vote_open\ndisplay_name: 投票须知\n\n[Input]\n{\n  \"alive\": [\n    \"1号 话痨小满\",\n    \"2号 你\",\n    \"3号 戏精阿浪\",\n    \"4号 逻辑控林工\",\n    \"5号 和事佬阿和\",\n    \"6号 稳健老陈\"\n  ],\n  \"game\": \"谁是卧底\",\n  \"history\": [\n    {\n      \"round\": 1,\n      \"speeches\": [\n        {\n          \"player\": \"话痨小满\",\n          \"seat\": 1,\n          \"text\": \"冬天早上赖床的时候，它把我裹得像个枕头卷\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"player\": \"你\",\n          \"seat\": 2,\n          \"text\": \"毛绒绒的，能帮你保暖\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"player\": \"戏精阿浪\",\n          \"seat\": 3,\n          \"text\": \"我跟你讲，缩在里面的时候谁也别想把我拽起来\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"player\": \"逻辑控林工\",\n          \"seat\": 4,\n          \"text\": \"有厚度的软织物，冷的时候拿来盖\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"player\": \"和事佬阿和\",\n          \"seat\": 5,\n          \"text\": \"软软的搭在身上，天冷的时候很安心\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"player\": \"稳健老陈\",\n          \"seat\": 6,\n          \"text\": \"薄薄一层贴在身上，不重但很踏实\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"phase\": \"投票\",\n  \"round\": 1,\n  \"rule\": \"根据全部发言投出你认为词语和大家不一样的人，不能投自己\"\n}\n\n[Upstream Outputs]\n(none)\n\n\n[Instruction]\n【裁判节点 · 投票须知】\n这是第 1 轮投票的开场节点。只输出一句话：本轮投票开始，请各位根据全部发言投票。\n不要复述发言，不要点评，不要透露任何词语或身份，不要超过 30 个字。\n","content_length":1652,"content_truncated":false,"content_truncated_bytes":0,"target":"bcs_message"}
