{"timestamp":"2026-08-28 13:20:55","level":"INFO","message":"node_dispatch","schema_version":1,"event_type":"node_dispatch","status":"routed","mode":"state_machine","session_id":"bcs_grp_0077606fd6414a9f865a6f3521b73929:c74ebcca","group_id":"bcs_grp_0077606fd6414a9f865a6f3521b73929","state_machine_run_id":"sm-6ad664ee-9abe-4cf8-93d6-19b8bf8f2fdc","run_id":"smnode-sm-6ad664ee-9abe-4cf8-93d6-19b8bf8f2fdc-vote_open-0","node_id":"vote_open","attempt":0,"bot_id":"玩家戏精阿浪","assignee_bot_id":"玩家戏精阿浪","delivery_request_id":"smnode-sm-6ad664ee-9abe-4cf8-93d6-19b8bf8f2fdc-vote_open-0","content":"[State Machine Task]\nnode_id: vote_open\ndisplay_name: 投票开场\n\n[Input]\n{\n  \"alive\": [\n    \"1号 戏精阿浪\",\n    \"2号 和事佬阿和\",\n    \"3号 稳健老陈\",\n    \"4号 你\",\n    \"5号 逻辑控林工\",\n    \"6号 话痨小满\"\n  ],\n  \"game\": \"谁是卧底\",\n  \"history\": [\n    {\n      \"round\": 1,\n      \"speeches\": [\n        {\n          \"player\": \"戏精阿浪\",\n          \"seat\": 1,\n          \"text\": \"我跟你讲，早上没它我都觉得自己像个野人\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"player\": \"和事佬阿和\",\n          \"seat\": 2,\n          \"text\": \"每天早上都得用它伺候一下下巴 Internet\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"player\": \"稳健老陈\",\n          \"seat\": 3,\n          \"text\": \"出门前脸上过一下，齐整多了\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"player\": \"你\",\n          \"seat\": 4,\n          \"text\": \"每天早上用它整理仪容仪表\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"player\": \"逻辑控林工\",\n          \"seat\": 5,\n          \"text\": \"手指端长了就剪短，随身带的金属件\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"player\": \"话痨小满\",\n          \"seat\": 6,\n          \"text\": \"贴着下巴走一遍，硬茬就全服帖了\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"phase\": \"投票\",\n  \"round\": 1,\n  \"rule\": \"根据全部发言投出你认为词语和大家不一样的人，不能投自己\"\n}\n\n[Upstream Outputs]\n(none)\n\n\n[Instruction]\n【开场节点】\n第 1 轮投票现在开始。这个节点只是运行的入口，你在这里不需要做任何判断。\n只输出两个字：开始\n不要输出别的任何内容，不要提到任何玩家、词语、发言或投票倾向。\n","content_length":1633,"content_truncated":false,"content_truncated_bytes":0,"target":"bcs_message"}
