{"timestamp":"2026-08-28 14:26:20","level":"INFO","message":"node_dispatch","schema_version":1,"event_type":"node_dispatch","status":"routed","mode":"state_machine","session_id":"bcs_grp_3d62802c66c34fe698af90268b6eafcf:0d520113","group_id":"bcs_grp_3d62802c66c34fe698af90268b6eafcf","state_machine_run_id":"sm-bfcfa746-0546-417d-97ee-342026153cdc","run_id":"smnode-sm-bfcfa746-0546-417d-97ee-342026153cdc-vote_open-0","node_id":"vote_open","attempt":0,"bot_id":"玩家戏精阿浪","assignee_bot_id":"玩家戏精阿浪","delivery_request_id":"smnode-sm-bfcfa746-0546-417d-97ee-342026153cdc-vote_open-0","content":"[State Machine Task]\nnode_id: vote_open\ndisplay_name: 投票开场\n\n[Input]\n{\n  \"alive\": [\n    \"1号 你\",\n    \"2号 戏精阿浪\",\n    \"3号 话痨小满\",\n    \"4号 逻辑控林工\",\n    \"5号 稳健老陈\",\n    \"6号 和事佬阿和\"\n  ],\n  \"game\": \"谁是卧底\",\n  \"history\": [\n    {\n      \"round\": 1,\n      \"speeches\": [\n        {\n          \"player\": \"你\",\n          \"seat\": 1,\n          \"text\": \"甜甜的很好喝，想每天都喝\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"player\": \"戏精阿浪\",\n          \"seat\": 2,\n          \"text\": \"说真的，心情差的时候第一个就想到它\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"player\": \"话痨小满\",\n          \"seat\": 3,\n          \"text\": \"路过门口闻到味儿腿就不听使唤了\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"player\": \"逻辑控林工\",\n          \"seat\": 4,\n          \"text\": \"一周至少得来一次，不然总觉得少了点什么\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"player\": \"稳健老陈\",\n          \"seat\": 5,\n          \"text\": \"天热的时候特别会惦记它\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"player\": \"和事佬阿和\",\n          \"seat\": 6,\n          \"text\": \"喝完之后好像整个人缓过来了\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"phase\": \"投票\",\n  \"round\": 1,\n  \"rule\": \"只根据所有人历史全部发言，投出你认为词语和大家不一样的人；不能投自己；只交票号，不写理由\"\n}\n\n[Upstream Outputs]\n(none)\n\n\n[Instruction]\n【开场节点】\n第 1 轮投票现在开始。这个节点只是运行的入口，你在这里不需要做任何判断。\n只输出两个字：开始\n不要输出别的任何内容，不要提到任何玩家、词语、发言或投票倾向。\n","content_length":1669,"content_truncated":false,"content_truncated_bytes":0,"target":"bcs_message"}
