{"timestamp":"2026-08-31 10:25:42","level":"INFO","message":"bot_event","schema_version":1,"event_type":"bot_event","status":"responded","mode":"free_chat","session_id":"bcs_grp_3df262e9bded41a58c2657e57c861773:ca262f22","group_id":"bcs_grp_3df262e9bded41a58c2657e57c861773","run_id":"d1639b69-d109-44d5-8918-7e75a6cf067e","task_id":"","bot_id":"谁是卧底主持人","from_bot_id":"谁是卧底主持人","chat_event_type":"agent","chat_event_state":"delta","content":"","content_length":0,"content_truncated":false,"content_truncated_bytes":0,"target":"bcs_message"}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-31 10:25:42","level":"INFO","message":"bot_event","schema_version":1,"event_type":"bot_event","status":"responded","mode":"free_chat","session_id":"bcs_grp_3df262e9bded41a58c2657e57c861773:ca262f22","group_id":"bcs_grp_3df262e9bded41a58c2657e57c861773","run_id":"d1639b69-d109-44d5-8918-7e75a6cf067e","task_id":"","bot_id":"谁是卧底主持人","from_bot_id":"谁是卧底主持人","chat_event_type":"chat.event","chat_event_state":"delta","content":"🕵️ 谁是卧底，六个人，其中一个是卧底。\n\n每个人会拿到一个词，六个词里有五个一样、一个不一样。**我不会告诉你你是哪一种**，你只会拿到一个词，剩下的自己判断。\n\n每轮先发言：按座位轮流，一人一句话形容自己的词，不能说出那个词。轮到你的时候右边副屏会弹出输入框，你的词就写在框的最上面。大家想词的时候我不打扰，都说完我一次念给你听。\n\n念完我直接开投，不用你喊。所有人同时投，票箱也在副屏。票最多的人出局，但**身份不公布**。\n\n卧底被投出去，平民赢；场上只剩两个人卧底还在，卧底赢。\n\n今天的牌友：稳健老陈、话痨小满、和事佬阿和、逻辑控林工、戏精阿浪，加上你。座位马上随机排。\n\n两件事：副屏里能点开别人的节点看详情，那等于开天眼，请自觉别点；另外每轮一到三分钟，中间没消息是正常的，超过五分钟没动静就回我一句\"卡住了\"。\n\n准备好就说\"开始\"。","content_length":1075,"content_truncated":false,"content_truncated_bytes":0,"target":"bcs_message"}
{"timestamp":"2026-08-31 10:25:42","level":"INFO","message":"bot_event","schema_version":1,"event_type":"bot_event","status":"responded","mode":"free_chat","session_id":"bcs_grp_3df262e9bded41a58c2657e57c861773:ca262f22","group_id":"bcs_grp_3df262e9bded41a58c2657e57c861773","run_id":"d1639b69-d109-44d5-8918-7e75a6cf067e","task_id":"","bot_id":"谁是卧底主持人","from_bot_id":"谁是卧底主持人","chat_event_type":"agent","chat_event_state":"delta","content":"","content_length":0,"content_truncated":false,"content_truncated_bytes":0,"target":"bcs_message"}
